Package: OdysseusSurvivalModule
Title: Cohort-Based Single-Event Survival Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexander", "Alexeyuk", , "AlexanderAlexeyuk@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to build single-event survival datasets from "OMOP CDM"
    cohorts and estimate survival outcomes. The package supports Kaplan-Meier,
    Cox proportional hazards, and parametric accelerated-failure-time models,
    with optional stratification by gender and age groups.
